## Transfer Services

All **Ensana Spa Hotels** can arrange airport transfers. Many guests book a private transfer directly from Prague or Munich Airport — comfortable and stress-free after a long journey.

The hotel reception can also arrange **local taxis** and **car hire** for excursions in the region.
